{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1540977-good-in-game-vtm-quotes","id":1540977,"title":"Good in-game VtM quotes?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-08-24T17:34:37-07:00","id":1540977,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon12.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Good in-game VtM quotes?","content":"I'm bored and we all haven't had a &quot;just for fun&quot; thread in a while...so anyone got any good quotes or one-liners to share from a chronicle, PC or SPC? I'll start with a few, just to get things going.<br /> <br /> <b>My Lasombra PC, who happened to be one of the city's Harpies</b>:<br /> <br /> (taking one look at another PC gearing up for combat in typical trenchcoat-and-katanas fashion) &quot;Who the fuck are you, the Teenage Mutant Ninja Ventrue?&quot;<br /> <br /> (ST mentioned one of the other Harpies was wearing Chanel no. 5) &quot;Jesus, it smells like cheap Nazi hookers in here. Someone get my Garand.&quot;<br /> <br /> (To a Sabbat Lasombra) &quot;My suit is Giorgio Armani, my watch is Patek Phillipe, and my tentacles are Toshio Maeda. Cross me at your shriveled undead rectum's peril.&quot;<br /> <br /> (About a Giovanni visitor to the city) &quot;Unless he's trying to make the trains run on time, I could give a fuck. If he is, I keep a flamethrower in the trunk.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>The Toreador Harpy NPC in the chronicle I'm currently running:</b><br /> <br /> &quot;If I'm dying I'm dying in Dolce &amp; Gabbana, not the forever 21-bucks-and-under clearance rack you got <i>that</i> potato sack from.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Of course I'm naked, that's a Versace original that cost more than you make in a year, and I'm not trusting some teenage wage slave to dry clean it.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Fuck with me and you'll be shitting Louboutins for the rest of your unlife...<i>heel first</i>.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;You bitches look like Hot Topic took a Chipotle shit on a truck stop bathroom wall.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;...you're gonna read me for filth looking like Pennywise on his way home from the glory holes?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;That bitch is so stupid she thought the BBC was a porn channel.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Holy shit, you look like you have Carrot Top in a leglock. Wax, it's not just for fun and games.&quot;<br /> <br /> (Tzimisce shows up) &quot;Listen. Lady Gaga is mother and we all know it, but there's a limit. You clearly discovered it and planted your flag on the nasty-ass-wannabe-ho side.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;We sneak in and spike the sacramental wine with Viagra. That'll keep the Inquisition busy for a few days.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>Gangrel NPC, same chronicle:</b><br /> <br /> Not so much a quote, but she threw a bottle of Coors Light at a werewolf's head while laughing maniacally to get its attention.<br /> <br /> &quot;She plays a stupid vapid slut in court, but outside court, she's also a stupid vapid slut.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;...the fuck is OnlyFans?&quot; (Toreador shows the Gangrel her bank account) &quot;Holy shit, how do I sign up?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I put up with a lot of shit, but NEVER. DISS. SHANIA.&quot; (immediately followed by frenzy)<br /> <br /> (Overheard by the PC's. Outside a mansion full of Russian mobsters, to another NPC) &quot;Put on Hulk Hogan's theme song right now or you're next on the list after these KGB reject thimble-dicks.&quot;<br /> <br /> (Song starts) &quot;Get out here and take your all-American ass-whoopin' like real men, you degenerate Commie fucks!&quot;<br /> <br /> (Running from the burning mansion after slaughtering most of the mobsters) &quot;RAISE HELL PRAISE DALE! WOOOOO!&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;So we playin' cornhole or we playin' <i>cornhole</i>?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude02","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/431-theodrim","name":"Theodrim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar431_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1841"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-24T18:01:28-07:00","id":1540978,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Theodrim</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1540977-good-in-game-vtm-quotes#post1540977\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(To a Sabbat Lasombra) &quot;My suit is Giorgio Armani, my watch is Patek Phillipe, and my tentacles are Toshio Maeda. Cross me at your shriveled undead rectum's peril.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Lol, Gold.<br /> <br /> Only one i can think of right now is my Social intimidation based Lasombra stealthily following her Nosferatu Coterie member down a human trafficking basement. The nosferatu gets a messy critical on his stealth roll while climbing down the stairs so he notifies one of the Thin Blood thanks to his beast predatory aura.<br /> <br /> The thin blood, scared, shoots her gun pre-emptively and says something along the lines of '' Don't come over, i'm not alone!'<br /> <br /> My Lasombra comes out of the shadow and says '' Oh, don't worry he's not alone neither my dear! ''.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26771-algarik","name":"Algarik","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26771_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"115"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-24T18:05:45-07:00","id":1540979,"title":"","content":"Oh shit, I remember another...a Toreador PC I had a long time ago, about a Giovanni who was attempting flattery:<br /> <br /> &quot;That's not a complement. He'd fuck an Arby's roast beef and swiss just because it reminded him of his sister.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude02","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/431-theodrim","name":"Theodrim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar431_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1841"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-24T18:47:48-07:00","id":1540982,"title":"","content":"Also, another one!<br /> <br /> <b>Antagonist Goratricine Tremere in this same chronicle:</b><br /> <br /> (Asked what his clan was, looks at the DJ and telepathically dominates him to play 'Macarena') &quot;Oh, my favorite song...such good timing. You know, when the song comes up, everyone -- absolutely everyone -- just can't wait to tell you how much they hate it, it's the worst song ever written, and how better a place the world would be if it just didn't exist. It's more than just a meme...it's a global compulsion, part of our collective conscious...that anyone who is anyone can't stand 'Macarena'. But when the song actually plays, you know what those same people who just moments before couldn't help but tell you how terrible 'Macarena' is do?&quot;<br /> <br /> (He gestures to the dance floor)<br /> <br /> &quot;They shut the fuck up and dance the Macarena.&quot;<br /> <br /> (Different scene) &quot;Vienna? I hadn't laughed that hard since 9/11. We partied for a week straight, I just wish I'd gotten to see it live. Nothing's better than long-awaited chickens come home to roost.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":431,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/431-theodrim","user":"Theodrim","date":". 08-24-2024, 09:56 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/431-theodrim","name":"Theodrim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar431_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1841"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-25T01:21:19-07:00","id":1540986,"title":"","content":"Conversation betweem a lasombra neonate and bishop regarding the ventrue.<br /> <br /> neonate: &quot; so the ventrue are a rival ruling clan like tne tzmisce?<br /> Bishop-&quot;yes, theirs differances in how we rule as well. They rule in the manner of mortal politicians wereas we are closer to monarchs. If im being reductive.&quot;<br /> neonate-&quot;with the fiends closer to some crazed african warlord with child soldiers.&quot;<br /> Bishop-&quot;hmmm? yes...yes i like that.&quot;<br /> <br /> Brujah trying socratoc questioning-&quot;so what both elders and Anarchs fear?&quot;<br /> Nosfertu-&quot;getting a real job?&quot;<br /> Malkavian-&quot;being productive?&quot;<br /> toreador-&quot;someone noticing they dont have anything to contribute?<br /> Brujah-&quot;.....i fucking hate you guys.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> Mage the ascention game<br /> <br /> :rescue mission of captured awakened orphans led by a hermetic. Mage leading an several children out of building in his full wizard regalia.&quot;<br /> <br /> Child-&quot; are you from hogwarts?&quot;<br /> <br /> Hermatic-&quot;.......why yes child, dimberlee doo sent me. Now get in the van.&quot;","signature":"","